From: =?UTF-8?q?Silas=20M=C3=BCller?= <github@silasmueller.de>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 20:32:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] pci: Support read-only vfio-user mmap areas
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Allow individual portions of vfio-user sparse mmap regions to use
read-only hypervisor memory slots. Reads continue through the shared
mapping while writes trap to the vfio-user region protocol. Validate
configured areas instead of silently falling back to writable mappings.

Signed-off-by: Silas Müller <github@silasmueller.de>
